#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:28
msgid "BlueOS Precision Landing Extension"
msgstr "BlueOS 精准降落扩展"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:28
msgid "IR-LOCK Sensor & Beacon"
msgstr "IR-LOCK 传感器和信标"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:28
msgid "Landmark Precision Landing System"
msgstr "Landmark 精准降落系统"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:5
#: 26b415cc0242466d8dfef0a1afdcfb51
msgid "Precision Landing and Loiter"
msgstr "精准降落与定点悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:7
#: 32fd88ab617f40fcb894927b9b9a421a
msgid ""
"Copter supports **Precision Landing** and **Precision Loiter**, which use an"
" external position reference (aka \"landing target\") to achieve centimeter-"
"level accuracy during landing or while hovering over a target."
msgstr "Copter 支持 **精准降落** 和 **精准悬停**，使用外部位置参考（即「降落目标」）在降落或在目标上方悬停时实现厘米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:9
#: 6ecaf7cc62164b159ac5673448f65768
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Precision Landing is supported via MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages sent"
" from a companion computer such as :ref:`BlueOS <precision-landing-blueos>`,"
" the `Landmark system <https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-"
"precision-landing-system>`__, or using the `IR-LOCK sensor "
"<https://irlock.com/products/ir-lock-sensor-precision-landing-kit>`__, "
"`beacon <https://irlock.com/products/markone-beacon-v3-0-beta>`__, and a "
":ref:`rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"精准降落通过伴飞计算机发送的 MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ 消息来实现，例如 "
"`Landmark 系统 <https://landmarklanding.com/products/landmark-precision-"
"landing-system>`__，或使用 `IR-LOCK 传感器 <https://irlock.com/products/ir-lock-"
"sensor-precision-landing-kit>`__、`信标 <https://irlock.com/products/markone-"
"beacon-v3-0-beta>`__ 以及 :ref:`测距仪 <common-rangefinder-landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:14
#: 5dc61bb137b447599e1905790bbb9591
msgid ""
"When the vehicle enters :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` and a landing target is"
" detected, the target's position will be used to guide the final descent. "
"Precision Landing can also be performed in :ref:`RTL mode <rtl-mode>` as the"
" final stage of the return-to-launch sequence."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器进入 :ref:`Land 模式 <land-mode>` 且检测到降落目标时，目标位置将用于引导最终下降。精准降落也可在 :ref:`RTL "
"模式 <rtl-mode>` 中作为返航序列的最终阶段执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:17
#: d1f03b77e7a345dfa156d0620f247a21
msgid ""
"Precision Loiter requires minimal additional setup and is activated by "
"entering :ref:`Loiter mode <loiter-mode>` mode and invoking the Precision "
"Loiter :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-auxiliary-functions>`."
msgstr ""
"精准悬停所需的额外设置极少，通过进入 :ref:`Loiter 模式 <loiter-mode>` 并激活精准悬停 :ref:`辅助功能 "
"<common-auxiliary-functions>` 即可启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:22
#: a82b53ea84ab4bbeb08402861a6a7c3c
msgid ""
"*This video demonstrates Precision Loiter followed by Precision Landing "
"using the Landmark Precision Landing System.*"
msgstr "*本视频演示了使用 Landmark 精准降落系统进行精准悬停后再精准降落的过程。*"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:26
#: 7cf08ec8559441729ef4115b401052d9
msgid "Available Systems"
msgstr "可用系统"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:37
#: 373eb3bc0cc84fab942733c31ea67d89
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:39
#: c6db65cfbcde42838524429fe1ae3466
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` = **1** and reboot to expose "
"parameters."
msgstr "将 :ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>` 设置为 **1** 并重启以显示相关参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:40
#: c4fdf65050ab43738a9b7d6cd90dae6f
msgid ""
"Select the landing target position source via :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` "
"(e.g., **1** = MAVLink `LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__, **2** = IR-"
"LOCK, **3** = Gazebo Sim, **4** = SITL; **0** disables)."
msgstr ""
"通过 :ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>` 选择降落目标位置来源（例如，**1** = MAVLink "
"`LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__，**2** = IR-"
"LOCK，**3** = Gazebo 仿真，**4** = SITL；**0** 为禁用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:41
#: 79e43bc26ba84539a2fd28d829d0b358
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the landing target camera/sensor x-axis is not pointing forward, "
"configure the mounting orientation using :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN "
"<PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`."
msgstr ""
"如果降落目标摄像头/传感器不是朝下安装，或 x 轴不朝向前方，请使用 :ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` 和 "
":ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>` 配置安装方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:42
#: be37f57fbc644d568a4f41a2e44bdb14
msgid ""
"Verify the target is detected while disarmed and the reported offsets change"
" as you move the target/vehicle."
msgstr "在上锁状态下确认目标被检测到，并在移动目标/飞行器时确认上报的偏移量有变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:43
#: 67b74f1d3db94547a218edfd335a5409
msgid "Take off and hover above the target."
msgstr "起飞并悬停在目标上方。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:44
#: a04d1c62d00f4cdf92780034498ce994
msgid ""
"(Recommended) Confirm stable tracking in Precision Loiter before attempting "
"Precision Landing."
msgstr "（推荐）在尝试精准降落之前，先在精准悬停中确认稳定跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:45
#: bb61c05e822b4d7aa48facc9a56dfe9d
msgid "Activate :ref:`Land mode <land-mode>` to initiate Precision Landing."
msgstr "激活 :ref:`Land 模式 <land-mode>` 以启动精准降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:48
#: 48ec04de21684b07872ebe31e1857f28
msgid ""
"Precision Landing requires a valid horizontal position estimate and a steady"
" attitude solution. Poor GPS/EKF or a noisy rangefinder will degrade "
"performance."
msgstr "精准降落需要有效的水平位置估计和稳定的姿态解算。GPS/EKF 质量差或测距仪噪声大都会降低性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:52
#: 43e4ce043b8743148c80cd933a3259a6
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:54
#: 7f416e73392644ddac5b74625fff1299
msgid ""
"With Precision Landing enabled and Land mode activated, the external landing"
" target measurements override the target provided by the GPS solution for "
"the final approach."
msgstr "启用精准降落并激活 Land 模式后，外部降落目标的测量值将在最终进近阶段覆盖 GPS 解算提供的目标位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:56
#: a9a9a61510cb44f984a5db8ddb4b812c
msgid ""
"If the landing target is not found, the vehicle will continue descending "
"vertically until the height specified by :ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`."
msgstr "如果未找到降落目标，飞行器将继续垂直下降，直到达到 :ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>` 指定的高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:58
#: 0c512cbfdda047cbaa1898ddf2c75417
msgid ""
"If the landing target is lost, the behaviour depends on :ref:`PLND_STRICT "
"<PLND_STRICT>`:"
msgstr "如果降落目标丢失，行为取决于 :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`："

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:60
#: 5b16c9df3d8a4a4a9ec433db6ad9d07e
msgid "**0** – continue landing using standard Land mode logic (not strict)."
msgstr "**0** – 使用标准 Land 模式逻辑继续降落（非严格模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:61
#: e6f0f7b7723e4f0cba4eca63aa898cc1
msgid ""
"**1** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` is "
"reached, then land normally."
msgstr "**1** – 执行降落重试，直到达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` 次，然后正常降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:62
#: 26f270f5f57e4dc09f8a5dcd6866cc82
msgid ""
"**2** – perform landing retries until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` is "
"reached, then hover instead of landing."
msgstr "**2** – 执行降落重试，直到达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` 次，然后悬停而非降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:64
#: 44aa2e99655e4d0da8f59e6322195fab
msgid ""
"When a landing retry is triggered, the vehicle will climb to a "
"height/position determined by :ref:`PLND_RET_BEHAVE <PLND_RET_BEHAVE>`. It "
"will then descend again in hopes of detecting the landing target. It will "
"keep doing this until :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX <PLND_RET_MAX>` retries have "
"occurred. Then, depending on :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`, the vehicle "
"will either just land, or it will stay in the air hovering (useful for, say,"
" landing on boats where you don’t want to land on water)."
msgstr ""
"触发降落重试时，飞行器将爬升至由 :ref:`PLND_RET_BEHAVE <PLND_RET_BEHAVE>` "
"确定的高度/位置，然后再次下降以尝试检测降落目标。将持续执行此操作，直到重试次数达到 :ref:`PLND_RET_MAX "
"<PLND_RET_MAX>`。之后根据 :ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` "
"的设置，飞行器将直接降落，或在空中保持悬停（适用于不希望降落在水面的船载场景等情况）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:70
#: 10bd91adf72c4eb689a5ef572791e98f
msgid ""
"If the landing target is lost below the height specified by "
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`, the vehicle will continue landing "
"vertically."
msgstr "如果在 :ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>` 指定高度以下丢失降落目标，飞行器将继续垂直降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:72
#: 8524d102c33a4dc790fd9c7480f94cc8
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's EKF assumes the landing target is stationary. Set "
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 0 if landing on a moving target."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的 EKF 假设降落目标静止不动。如需在移动目标上降落，请设置 :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`"
" 的第 0 位。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:74
#: 7cd50840f7f149a5bb4023c78bff20fe
msgid ""
"Repositioning manually by the pilot during the landing will abort the "
"landing unless :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 1 (Allow Precision "
"Landing after manual reposition)is set."
msgstr ""
"降落过程中飞手手动重新定位将中止降落，除非设置了 :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` 第 1 "
"位（允许手动重定位后继续精准降落）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:76
#: 96125769575a4a538779dd91a875d517
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Final landing speed may be reduced below :ref:`LAND_SPD_MS<LAND_SPD_MS>` as "
"necessary to assure a precise touchdown. This can be disabled for a faster "
"final land speed by setting :ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` bit 2."
msgstr ""
"最终降落速度可能降低至 :ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>` 以下，以确保精准接地。若需更快的最终降落速度，可通过设置 "
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>` 第 2 位来禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:82
#: 3572a414405648118a9f47795365b28f
msgid ""
"*This video demonstrates the behaviour of different PLND_STRICT settings.*"
msgstr "*本视频演示了不同 PLND_STRICT 设置的行为。*"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:86
#: 01b26828b1e140dd9968e004d6ddf43d
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:88
#: 60cf6e90fb014f179a8ed7d4f026eb3d
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>`: Set to 1 to enable Precision Landing. "
"Refresh parameters to see following:"
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_ENABLED <PLND_ENABLED>`：设置为 1 以启用精准降落。刷新参数以查看以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:89
#: dd27a00a38684b8db0dd92b949e809fe
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>`: Sets the type of landing target position "
"source."
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_TYPE <PLND_TYPE>`：设置降落目标位置来源的类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:90
#: 130a978bcc234b01831d076ed5966f7e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN <PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`: Sets the mounting yaw orientation of"
" the landing target camera/sensor with respect to body frame forward."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_ORIENT <PLND_ORIENT>` / :ref:`PLND_YAW_ALIGN "
"<PLND_YAW_ALIGN>`：设置降落目标摄像头/传感器的安装方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:91
#: 2c3a7c13540e4771a84758bf26241482
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_X <PLND_LAND_OFS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_Y "
"<PLND_LAND_OFS_Y>`: Sets the desired landing position of the camera/sensor "
"relative to the target. See :ref:`common-sensor-offset-compensation` page "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_X <PLND_LAND_OFS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_LAND_OFS_Y "
"<PLND_LAND_OFS_Y>`：设置摄像头/传感器相对于目标的期望降落位置。更多信息请参见 :ref:`common-sensor-offset-"
"compensation` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:92
#: b4fbbc8e5479436e97e6804416fb3d4f
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z <PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`: Sets the "
"camera/sensor position relative to the vehicle body frame."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_X <PLND_CAM_POS_X>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Y "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Y>` / :ref:`PLND_CAM_POS_Z "
"<PLND_CAM_POS_Z>`：设置摄像头/传感器相对于飞行器机体坐标系的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:93
#: a1928e97ccb04e5d900a88b96e3f7db2
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_XY_DIST_MAX <PLND_XY_DIST_MAX>`: Even if the landing target is "
"detected, the vehicle will not start descending if it is further than this "
"many meters away. Set to 0 to always descend."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_XY_DIST_MAX "
"<PLND_XY_DIST_MAX>`：即使检测到降落目标，若飞行器距离目标超过此距离（米），也不会开始下降。设置为 0 则始终下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:94
#: bde0b55e87ec4902adb235bac9566b28
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`: Controls the landing behaviour if the "
"target is lost."
msgstr ":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>`：控制目标丢失时的降落行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:95
#: 1ae21e0076494ff8bb73ba4762e3c504
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`: If the target is lost below this height,"
" the vehicle will continue descending vertically. Set to 0 to disable this."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MIN <PLND_ALT_MIN>`：如果在此高度以下丢失目标，飞行器将继续垂直下降。设置为 0 可禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:96
#: 45f343105aec4ce4a6363e2e6eccf9e7
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`: If the target is not detected, the "
"vehicle will continue descending vertically until this height. Below this "
"height, if the target is still not found, the landing retry logic set by "
":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` will be applied. Set to 0 to disable this."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_ALT_MAX <PLND_ALT_MAX>`：如果未检测到目标，飞行器将继续垂直下降至此高度。低于此高度若仍未找到目标，将应用 "
":ref:`PLND_STRICT <PLND_STRICT>` 设置的降落重试逻辑。设置为 0 可禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:97
#: da059605558e4f8d82ad15c0c0f5d442
msgid ""
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`: Set bit 0 if landing target is moving, "
"set bit 1 to allow the precision landing to continue after a manual "
"reposition, and set bit 2 to enable a faster final descent."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PLND_OPTIONS <PLND_OPTIONS>`：若降落目标在移动则设置第 0 位，设置第 1 "
"位允许手动重定位后继续精准降落，设置第 2 位启用更快的最终下降速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:99
#: fc96e3e2aec24fd9a6a62a28f3bfbf0d
msgid ""
"Additional ``PLND_`` parameters are listed in the `Complete Parameter List "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#plnd-parameters>`__."
msgstr ""
"其余 ``PLND_`` 参数列在 `完整参数列表 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/parameters.html#plnd-parameters>`__ 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:103
#: 6b6523ecb4b84d478efe7d087b2a324f
msgid "Precision Loiter"
msgstr "精准悬停"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:105
#: cdff1de8e52b4e2b8b07e0a7e9061941
msgid ""
"Precision Loiter uses the same backend and parameters as Precision Landing."
msgstr "精准悬停使用与精准降落相同的后端和参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:107
#: 874ce00c2fbd4903bf04b857819d7e49
msgid ""
"To enable Precision Loiter, set an :ref:`Auxiliary Function Switch <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` to 39 (PrecLoiter Enable)."
msgstr ""
"要启用精准悬停，请将一个 :ref:`辅助功能开关 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 设置为 39（PrecLoiter "
"Enable）。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:109
#: 95d887c3414d4cc3b4cd152470871e2a
msgid ""
"Entering Loiter mode and activating the switch will cause the vehicle to "
"hold its position above the target."
msgstr "进入 Loiter 模式并激活开关后，飞行器将保持在目标上方的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:113
#: aee0074618a446afb9848789ab7df728
msgid "MAVLink LANDING_TARGET Message Based Systems"
msgstr "基于 MAVLink LANDING_TARGET 消息的系统"

#: ../../source/docs/precision-landing-and-loiter.rst:115
#: d20398b298304a0d8187eba61141f11e
msgid ""
"Using a companion computer, camera, and fiducial marker system such as "
"`AprilTag <https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/vision-"
"processing/apriltag/apriltag-intro.html>`__, the position differences to the"
" landing target location can be sent to the autopilot using MAVLink "
"`LANDING_TARGET "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#LANDING_TARGET>`__ messages. "
"Here is an example system description: `Precision Landing with Realsense "
"T265 Camera and AprilTag <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/precision-landing-"
"with-realsense-t265-camera-and-apriltag-part-1-2/48978>`__"
msgstr ""
"使用伴飞计算机、摄像头和基准标记系统（例如 `AprilTag "
"<https://docs.wpilib.org/en/stable/docs/software/vision-"
